-- Shorter signup texts: the same 14 questions, with the longest prompts cut
-- down in all 10 languages (the user's choice: keep every question, shorten
-- the wording). Every keyword a prompt names is still in that language's
-- kw_* list. Fewer characters means fewer SMS segments, which matters most
-- outside English, where one segment holds only 70 characters.
